PREVENT: Before the Change

Picture
- Every wireframe, dot, HUD element and light effect is drawn in code (film.js, models.js, engine/). No generated or stock images.
- The part, drawing, parts list, station and figures are invented. No real part, drawing, ECR, system screenshot, person or logo appears.
- engine/holo.js and engine/hud.js are copied from the Lemo-Opuscar library (style "Sci-fi Hologram HUD"), MIT licence.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence files in fonts/)
- Rajdhani, Indian Type Foundry
- Share Tech Mono, Carrois Apostrophe

Voice
- Kokoro TTS v1.0 (hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0), voice bm_george, via kokoro-onnx. A stand-in: replace with your own recording.

Music and sound
- Original score and all sound effects synthesised in numpy (mix.py, with helpers from the library's core/audio/sfx.py, MIT). No samples.
